<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore Land H1 net profit up 4.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Singapore Land H1 net profit up 4.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Singapore dollars unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  41.69  vs   40.05</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		 12.1   vs   11.7</p>
<p>    Turnover			    68.07  vs   66.94</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  50.21  vs   49.24</p>
<p>    Investment income		  1.60  vs    1.58</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		 5.74  vs    6.95</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	  8.78  vs    7.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    54.85  vs   51.26</p>
<p>    Tax				   13.16  vs   11.21</p>
<p>Note - Singapore Land Ltd is a property owner and developer.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
